t": "According to the Turkish-German University's website, the university's library is a member of ANKOS, which provides access to a vast collection of electronic resources, including e-books, journals, and databases."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1239, "end": 1242, "text": "[1]"}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1244, "end": 1394, "text": "Furthermore, ANKOS's own website lists Turkish-German University as one of its member institutions, along with other prominent universities in Turkey."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1395, "end": 1398, "text": "[2]"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1400, "end": 1679, "text": "In addition, a report published by the Turkish National Library and Archives (TÜBİTAK) in 2020 lists Turkish-German University as a member of ANKOS, highlighting the university's efforts to improve its library services and resources through collaboration with other institutions."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1680, "end": 1683, "text": "[3]"}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1685, "end": 1699, "text": "**Conclusion**"}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1701, "end": 1864, "text": "Based on the evidence presented above, it is clear that Turkish-German University is a member of the Anatolian University Libraries Consortium Association (ANKOS)."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1865, "end": 2048, "text": "This membership provides the university's students and faculty with access to a wide range of academic resources and opportunities for collaboration with other institutions in Turkey."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2049, "end": 2063, "text": "**References**"}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2065, "end": 2095, "text": "[1] Turkish-German University."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1",