2020) explored the impact of CCC-OER membership on student learning outcomes at Turkish-German University."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1736, "end": 1898, "text": "The study found that students who used open educational resources had higher levels of engagement and motivation compared to those who used traditional textbooks."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1899, "end": 1913, "text": "**References**"}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1915, "end": 2011, "text": "* \"Open Education in Turkey: A Case Study of Turkish-German University's Membership in CCC-OER.\""}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2012, "end": 2043, "text": "Journal of Open Education, vol."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2044, "end": 2050, "text": "2, no."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2051, "end": 2063, "text": "1, 2019, pp."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2064, "end": 2070, "text": "12-25."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2071, "end": 2166, "text": "* \"The Impact of CCC-OER Membership on Student Learning Outcomes at Turkish-German University.\""}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2167, "end": 2220, "text": "International Journal of Educational Technology, vol."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2221, "end": 2228, "text": "10, no."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2229, "end": 2241, "text": "2, 2020, pp."}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2242, "end": 2248, "text": "34-47."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2249, "end": 2277, "text": "* Turkish-German University."}, "D2S28": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2278, "end": 2299, "text": "\"CCC-OER Membership.\""}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Turkish-German Univer